### upload
POST {{httpUrl}}/api/v1/document/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

# 产品手册
## 概述
这是产品手册的概述内容。
## 安装
安装步骤如下：
1. 下载安装包
2. 解压
3. 运行安装程序

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="userId"

user_123

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="visibility"

public

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tags"

产品,手册

--WebAppBoundary--

### updateMetadata
POST {{httpUrl}}/api/v1/document/update-metadata
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user_123",
  "documentId": "your-document-id",
  "title": "产品手册 V2"
}

### updateContent
POST {{httpUrl}}/api/v1/document/update-content
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test-v2.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

# 产品手册 V2
这是更新后的内容。

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="userId"

user_123

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="documentId"

your-document-id

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="changeLog"

更新价格信息

--WebAppBoundary--

### delete
POST {{httpUrl}}/api/v1/document/delete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user_123",
  "documentId": "your-document-id"
}

### restore
POST {{httpUrl}}/api/v1/document/restore
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user_123",
  "documentId": "your-document-id"
}

### rollback
POST {{httpUrl}}/api/v1/document/rollback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user_123",
  "documentId": "your-document-id",
  "targetVersionId": "your-version-id"
}
